This repository is made available for research transparency and review of the
EMA MICCAI 2026 paper:

Accelerating Chest X-ray Report Generation for Tuberculosis Screening in
Indonesia: An Efficiency-Aware Benchmark of Quantized and Distilled
Vision-Language Models

Unless and until a separate open-source licence is added, no permission is
granted to copy, redistribute, sublicense, sell, or create derivative works from
the repository contents, except where such rights are already permitted by law
or by the licences of third-party components.

The institutional chest X-ray/report dataset, patient-level metadata,
case-level predictions, merged checkpoints, full base-model checkpoints, and
third-party model weights are not distributed in this repository and are not
covered by this repository licence.

The study-produced LoRA adapter artefacts included under `models/adapters/`
are provided for research transparency and reproducibility review only, subject
to this pending licence status and the applicable upstream base-model,
institutional-governance, and data-use requirements. They are not intended for
clinical use.

Third-party software, base models, model weights, and external tools retain
their original licences and terms. Users are responsible for complying with all
applicable model-provider, software, ethics, privacy, institutional-governance,
and data-use requirements.
